{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/562","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/562/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/562/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/562/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sveltejs/kit/issues/562","id":833630319,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU4MzM2MzAzMTk=","number":562,"title":"kit: page store does not update when navigating to the same page with a query parameter","user":{"login":"GrygrFlzr","id":1460917,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NjA5MTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1460917?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GrygrFlzr","html_url":"https://github.com/GrygrFlzr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GrygrFlzr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GrygrFlzr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GrygrFlzr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GrygrFlzr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GrygrFlzr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GrygrFlzr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GrygrFlzr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GrygrFlzr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GrygrFlzr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2428470026,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNDI4NDcwMDI2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2021-03-17T10:36:31Z","updated_at":"2021-03-31T19:51:29Z","closed_at":"2021-03-19T19:34:26Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nWhen navigating to the same page with a query parameter (e.g. from `/` to `/?lang=jp`) the page store from `$app/stores` does not update. Navigating either by `<a>` tag or by `goto()` has the same result.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n```bash\r\nnpm init svelte@next\r\n# js-only and css\r\nnpm install\r\nnpm run dev\r\n```\r\nReplace `index.svelte` with the following:\r\n```svelte\r\n<script>\r\n\timport { page } from '$app/stores';\r\n\timport { goto } from '$app/navigation';\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key-Values:</h3>\r\n{#each Array.from($page.query) as [key, value]}\r\n\t<p>{key}: {value}</p>\r\n{/each}\r\n<pre>Query: {$page.query.toString()}</pre>\r\n\r\n{#if $page.query.get('lang') === 'jp'}\r\n\t<h1>こんにちは</h1>\r\n{:else}\r\n\t<h1>Hello World!</h1>\r\n{/if}\r\n\r\n<button on:click={() => goto('/?lang=jp')}>Goto</button>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/?lang=jp\">Anchor Tag</a>\r\n```\r\nClick either the button or the anchor tag to see a lack of update. Refresh the page to see the actual update.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nThat the page store is updated without refreshing the page. e.g. Hello World to change to こんにちは.\r\n\r\n**Information about your SvelteKit Installation:**\r\n```\r\n  System:\r\n    OS: Windows 10 10.0.19042\r\n    CPU: (16) x64 AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor\r\n    Memory: 18.32 GB / 31.95 GB\r\n  Binaries:\r\n    Node: 14.16.0 - C:\\Program Files\\nodejs\\node.EXE\r\n    Yarn: 1.22.10 - ~\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\yarn.CMD\r\n    npm: 7.6.1 - C:\\Program Files\\nodejs\\npm.CMD\r\n  Browsers:\r\n    Chrome: 89.0.4389.90\r\n    Edge: Spartan (44.19041.423.0), Chromium (89.0.774.50)\r\n    Internet Explorer: 11.0.19041.1\r\n  npmPackages:\r\n    @sveltejs/kit: next => 1.0.0-next.49\r\n    svelte: ^3.29.0 => 3.35.0\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Severity**\r\nYou could use `rel=external` to force the page load, but that's janky and not necessarily appropriate for all use cases.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Rich-Harris","id":1162160,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjIxNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1162160?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris","html_url":"https://github.com/Rich-Harris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/562/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sveltejs/kit/issues/562/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}